{
  "$comment": "Which version of the template this repository is on, and which paths the foundation owns. tools/foundation/manifest.mjs validates it. owned: globs kept in step across products; a product change there is worth offering back. seams: files inside an owned area that every product fills in; never compared or overwritten. Everything else is starter content: shipped once, yours from then on. base and scaffold are null in the template; init-app writes them for a product (the version and commit it was scaffolded from, and the answers it was given) so `pnpm foundation:status` can rebuild that base exactly.",
